is_error":false,"num_turns":1,"subtype":"success","api_error_status":null,"result":"{\"grade\":\"partial\",\"rationale\":\"The answer covers most of the central checklist accurately. It names the trust/registered fund, board with independent trustees, officers, compliance program/CCO, adviser/sponsor, distributor/underwriter, custodian, fund accountant/administrator, transfer agent and independent auditor. It covers AP creation/redemption processing and basket handling (a rough stand-in for the PCF workflow), exchange listing, and NSCC/DTC clearing and settlement. It correctly makes the index licence strategy-dependent and securities lending optional, and says roles may be bundled with one provider or affiliates under board oversight. It contains no material errors. However, it omits several items from the key points: seed capital, market-making/lead market maker arrangements, legal counsel and pricing/valuation support. It also does not expressly say the CCO and compliance program can be shared platform arrangements, though its general bundling statement partly covers this. Missing seed capital, market-making, counsel and pricing are substantive gaps in a launch checklist, so the answer is partial rather than correct.\"}","ttft_ms":2677,"type":"result","duration_ms":5842,"uuid":"a44bfd5b-0077-4567-937e-31f5f508cd7e","ttft_stream_ms":551,"time_to_request_ms":67,"first_content_frame_ms":551,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0,"credential_expires_at":"2026-11-28T06:36:39.484Z"}
